<p><a name="tiers"></a></p>
<div class="pricing-table-container">
  <div class="pricing-tables attached" data-list-id="pricing_plans" data-list-name="Pricing Plans">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-sm-4 col-md-4">
        <div class="plan first">
          <div class="head">
            <h2>Solo</h2>
          </div>
          <h4>Individuals and<br />students</h4>
          <ul class="item-list">
            <li>Personal use only</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="item-list">
            <li>1 device, 4 ports</li>
            <li>1,000 flows per port</li>
            <li>1 Gbps per port</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="item-list">
            <li><strong>Includes:</strong></li>
            <li>Standard protocols</li>
            <li>Port statistics</li>
            <li>Device emulation</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="price">
            <h3><span class="symbol">$</span>12<span class="period">/mo</span></h3>
            <h4>Billed Annually</h4>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="buy-btn pdl" data-personal-use-only="" data-price-id="pri_01k4vymc5dd6vyhm1wajdd3zrh">
                  Buy
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-sm-4 col-md-4 ">
        <div class="plan recommended">
          <div class="head">
            <h2>Pro</h2>
          </div>
          <h4>Consultants and<br />small businesses</h4>
          <ul class="item-list">
            <li>Commercial use</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="item-list">
            <li>2 devices, 8 ports</li>
            <li>10,000 flows per port</li>
            <li>10 Gbps per port</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="item-list">
            <li><strong>Everything in Solo, plus:</strong></li>
            <li>User-defined protocols</li>
            <li>Stream statistics</li>
            <li>Turbo 10G add-on ready</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="price">
            <h3><span class="symbol">$</span>49<span class="period">/mo</span></h3>
            <h4>Billed Annually</h4>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="buy-btn pdl" data-price-id="pri_01k4wwmpm1v9chr4bw7vp14hf0">
                  Buy
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-sm-4 col-md-4  ">
        <div class="plan last">
          <div class="head">
            <h2>Business</h2>
          </div>
          <h4>Organizations with<br />advanced needs</h4>
          <ul class="item-list">
            <li>Commercial use</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="item-list">
            <li>4 devices, 16 ports</li>
            <li>1 million flows per port</li>
            <li>No bandwidth limit</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="item-list">
            <li><strong>Everything in Pro, plus:</strong></li>
            <li>Protocol emulation</li>
            <li>Automation API</li>
            <li>RFC 2544 Perf-Bench</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="price">
            <h3><span class="symbol">$</span>208<span class="period">/mo</span></h3>
            <h4>Billed Annually</h4>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="buy-btn pdl" data-price-id="pri_01k4wwpa2pjpqxapsmth4m9etv">
                  Buy
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div> <!-- row-->
    <div class="footnote">See <a href="#compare">detailed feature comparison</a></div>
  </div> <!-- pricing-tables -->
</div>

<p class="center"><a name="labbing"></a>
<a href="https://www.capterra.com/p/231149/Ostinato/reviews/"><img src="https://brand-assets.capterra.com/badge/e7048719-2ccb-4e5a-9fac-d84ba9c16682.png" alt="Ostinato is TOP rated on Capterra" /></a></p>

<h1 class="center" id="labbing-platforms">Labbing platforms</h1>

<p class="center">All the power of <a href="#tiers">Solo</a>, drop-in ready for your favorite labbing platform.<br />
Stop pinging, start traffic-testing!</p>

